# WhatsApp. Drawn by Nikola. A speech bubble filling the canvas with a spike tail off the
# lower left, holding two message lines, the top one long and the lower one short so it
# reads as text rather than as a pattern.
#
# Emerald ramp, brand 25d366 with 5fe98f as the top light row and 0f7a44 as the outline.
# Endesga's green was not usable, 63c74d and 3e8948 are Spotify's exact fills and the two
# sit next to each other in the panel.
#
# Claude first drew the handset from the real mark here. It turned into a plain diagonal
# slash at 16 px, so Nikola replaced it with the message lines, which stay crisp. The cost
# is that nothing WhatsApp specific is left, so Signal, Telegram or Element would all want
# this same picture and need another way to tell themselves apart.
A 25d366
B 5fe98f
C 0f7a44
D ffffff
